# Copy this file to .env.local and add your own Gemini API key.
# Get a free one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# WARNING: This ships the key straight to the browser (see the fetch
# call in useVoiceAssistant.ts). That's fine for local testing, but
# never deploy a build with a real key baked in like this — anyone can
# read it from the page source and burn through your free quota. For
# production, put the API call behind your own backend instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
